{"text": "ALSTON & BIRD\n\n555 Fayetteville Street, Suite 600\nRaleigh, NC 27601-3034\n919-862-2200 | Fax: 919-862-2260\n\nMatthew P. McGuire Direct Dial: 919-862-2279\n\nMay 8, 2018\n\nVia Email and First Class Mail\n\nAndrew T. Houston, Esq.\nMoon Wright & Houston\n121 West Trade Street\nSuite 1950\nCharlotte, NC 28202\n\nRe: In re: TS! Holdings, LLC\nCase No. 17-30132\n\nDear Andy:\n\nEmail: matt.meguire@alston.com\n\n| write on behalf of myself, Joe Grier, and Lane Williamson in response to your\nletter dated May 7, 2018. Thank you for your clients\u2019 willingness to support an interim\ndistribution of funds to investors who were harmed as a result of Rick Siskey\u2019s actions.\nMr. Grier, Mr. Williamson and | are very close to finalizing the terms of a comprehensive\nsettlement, as Judge Whitley advised us to do last month. This settlement will include a\nproposed interim distribution of $15,000,000 to investors with allowed claims. We trust\nthat your clients will be similarly supportive of this interim distribution.\n\nSincerely yours,\n\nMatthew P. McGuire\n\ncc: Joseph W. Grier, Ill, Esq. (via Email)\nF. Lane Williamson, Esq. (via Email)\n\nAlston & Bird LLP\n\nwww.alston.com\n\nAtlanta | Beijing | Brussels | Charlotte | Dallas | Los Angeles | New York | Raleigh | San Francisco { Silicon Valley | Washington, D.C.",
